 ដើម្បីឈ្នះ\n\n[ ព្រៃបិសាច ] - អ្នកដើរឬរត់វានឹងតាមសម្លាប់\n[ ភូមិខ្មោច  ] - ដើររកសំណែងមកសែនក្រោមដើមឈើ\n[ ចំការ        ] - ជីករកកំណប់ ចំណាំមិនត្រូវមើលខ្មោចយូបើមិនចង់ឱ្យខ្មោចចាប់ចូលក្នុងផ្នូរ។\n\n★  Everyone must pass through the Demon Forest and the Ghost Village to reach the farm where the treasure is buried. The treasure is buried in a grave. Dig it up and bring it to Kear to win.\n\n[ Demon Forest ] – If you walk or run, it will hunt you down and kill you.\n\n[ Ghost Village ] – Find offerings and bring them to place under the tree.\n\n[ The Farm ] – Dig for the treasure. Be careful: don't look at the ghost for too long, or it will catch you and drag you into the grave.","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d7cecc2dd8b14fb658b0346fe0c1f07e/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}